==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|Изслѣдованiе||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From the verb {{m|ru|иссле́довать|t=to explore, examine}}, which in turn comes from the noun {{m|ru|след|t=track, trail, mark}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|иссле́дование|pos=n}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-исследование.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|иссле́дование}}

# [[research]], [[study]]
# [[exploration]], [[investigation]]
# [[analysis]]
# [[research]] [[paper]], [[study]]

====Usage notes====
Used in the plural more often than in English, especially when referring to research in general rather than a particular study.

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|иссле́дование}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|изуче́ние}}, {{l|ru|ана́лиз}}

====Related terms====
